<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34670" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφῠσιόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσις</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inspire, infuse life
			into</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀνάγνωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Es.</u>
					9.48
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be inspired</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς
				ῥήμασιν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>implant, instil into</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αἰδεῖσθαι ἐμφυσιῶσαί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεφυσίωσαν τοῖς γινομένοις ἐξ ἑαυτῶν
					τὴν βούλησιν τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Michel</u>
					855.9
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae.) :— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάθησις δεξιῶς ἐμφυσιωθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Lex</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα ἐμφυσιῶται ἑκάστῳ τὸ κάλλιστον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Charond.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.2.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπεφυσιωμένη κακία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					28.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
